                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a17c7856-c6ac-4a73-8deb-99767bec166b",
                        "source_entry_id": "7876ca4a-04e9-3d32-8cb6-166429524f46",
                        "target_lang_word": "requisite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "requisite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7c593d2-c49c-39cb-add2-0dc648c40756",
                                        "entry_id": "b82b4deb-0417-39f1-8c13-dfca66629eb2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Essential, indispensable, required."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be3e4aed-fd25-4317-a94b-18514c0a9816",
                                                "sense_id": "b7c593d2-c49c-39cb-add2-0dc648c40756",
                                                "text": "Please submit the requisite papers before the end of the financial year."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0eee8cc1-92a0-4ad0-99b7-eecfbe01e645",
                                                "sense_id": "b7c593d2-c49c-39cb-add2-0dc648c40756",
                                                "text": "They ſay he is the King of Perſea.\nBut if he dare attempt to ſtir your ſiege,\nTwere requiſite he ſhould be ten times more,\nFor all fleſh quakes at your magnificence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "129033ab-3099-4785-a97e-c0f17897f18d",
                                                "sense_id": "b7c593d2-c49c-39cb-add2-0dc648c40756",
                                                "text": "[W]e endeavour to preſent our Gard'ners with a compleat Cycle of what is requiſite to be done throughout every Moneth of the Year: [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbff4d3c-8919-4d24-ba7d-295488fa289b",
                                                "sense_id": "b7c593d2-c49c-39cb-add2-0dc648c40756",
                                                "text": "On the other hand, there will be widespread agreement with Sir Brian's belief that, when a British main line has been completely dieselised and the schedules have been recast to suit the new traction, much higher daily mileages than 350 are not only possible but requisite, at least in the early stages of dieselisation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "requisite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc6a4a3b-2aee-3491-be39-844b674348c9",
                                        "entry_id": "0fbb64e9-d4da-3119-9fe0-b740427d6d17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An indispensable item; a requirement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf154a4a-ad62-418c-a111-f926838ce9f1",
                                                "sense_id": "cc6a4a3b-2aee-3491-be39-844b674348c9",
                                                "text": "She had a good sort of coarse cleverness, admirably fitted to get on in the world; she possessed those two first requisites, a good constitution and a good temper;..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "134e5297-f560-4736-aca8-488331b15746",
                                                "sense_id": "cc6a4a3b-2aee-3491-be39-844b674348c9",
                                                "text": "But this something, what is it, unless the happiness of others, or some of the requisites of happiness?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "475a1d69-395c-4603-8dc2-bcc23bdf2655",
                                                "sense_id": "cc6a4a3b-2aee-3491-be39-844b674348c9",
                                                "text": "The main requisite is to brew a tasty, palateful and wholesome beer […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a706adc1-cd14-48e5-b748-387daefb119f",
                        "source_entry_id": "7876ca4a-04e9-3d32-8cb6-166429524f46",
                        "target_lang_word": "requirement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "requirement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4a35302-be37-3256-9ed1-ac7347cb5678",
                                        "entry_id": "574818a6-9d83-3ca3-ad88-60b42b0d41e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A necessity or prerequisite; something required or obligatory. Its adpositions are generally of in relation to who or what has given it, on in relation to whom or what it is given to, and for in relation to what is required."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cd13624-c242-4f57-8716-5120d7473c0a",
                                                "sense_id": "e4a35302-be37-3256-9ed1-ac7347cb5678",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: necessity, prerequisite, requisite, condition, rule"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "209d1da9-8d29-43d5-b0be-572d629050e1",
                                                "sense_id": "e4a35302-be37-3256-9ed1-ac7347cb5678",
                                                "text": "The requirements of life as we know it include carbon, oxygen, hydrogen, water, and energy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12c4d5e6-6ef8-3762-990f-56872162e998",
                                        "entry_id": "574818a6-9d83-3ca3-ad88-60b42b0d41e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something asked."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56e85d72-87a4-4903-a019-5e1f02ac06e9",
                                                "sense_id": "12c4d5e6-6ef8-3762-990f-56872162e998",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: request"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b98ebd48-2452-3cbf-9bb8-1e29e2edf9b3",
                                        "entry_id": "574818a6-9d83-3ca3-ad88-60b42b0d41e7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A statement (in domain specific terms) which specifies a verifiable constraint on an implementation that it shall undeniably meet or (a) be deemed unacceptable, or (b) result in implementation failure, or (c) result in system failure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "258ea162-fa5a-4b0e-b0cc-4391536d343f",
                                                "sense_id": "b98ebd48-2452-3cbf-9bb8-1e29e2edf9b3",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: specification, rule"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fbffb44-183a-46af-b2b2-542c00a50e56",
                                                "sense_id": "b98ebd48-2452-3cbf-9bb8-1e29e2edf9b3",
                                                "text": "System requirements not met. Go to Settings to learn more."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
